Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Breadcrumb,Navigation|
		|testray.main.component.name|Navigation|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Breadcrumb Configuration
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|BreadcrumbUsecase#BreadcrumbConfiguration|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add Child
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
		|siteChildPageName|Child Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page goto Child Page PG
		|childPageName|Child Page Name|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Checkboxes
		|checkSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Page,Show Parent Sites,Show Application Breadcrumb|
		|uncheckSetupName|Show Guest Site|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|checkSetupName|Show Guest Site,Show Application Breadcrumb|
		|uncheckSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Page,Show Parent Sites|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListNotVisible|Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page goto Child Page PG
		|childPageName|Child Page Name|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListNotVisible|Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|checkSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Application Breadcrumb|
		|uncheckSetupName|Show Guest Site,Show Page,Show Parent Sites|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListNotVisible|Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page goto Child Page PG
		|childPageName|Child Page Name|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListNotVisible|Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|checkSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Application Breadcrumb,Show Guest Site,Show Page|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay,Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page goto Child Page PG
		|childPageName|Child Page Name|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
	Then Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay,Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
Scenario: Breadcrumb Link Points To Localhost
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|BreadcrumbUsecase#BreadcrumbLinkPointsToLocalhost|
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Specific URL Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|url|${portalURL}/web/site-name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|checkSetupName|Show Guest Site|
	And Navigator goto Specific URL Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|url|http://127.0.0.1:8080/web/site-name|
	And AssertLocation the value 'http://127.0.0.1:8080/web/site-name'
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay,Site Name,Site Page Name|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	And these variables
		|key_URL|${portalURL}|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'BreadcrumbPortlet#BREADCRUMB_PAGE_LINK'
	And these variables
		|key_URL|/web/guest|
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'LIFERAY' at locator 'BreadcrumbPortlet#BREADCRUMB_PAGE_LINK'